<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pru starts five auto finance cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pru starts five auto finance cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities started coverage of five automobile finance companies, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Started Union Acceptance Corp, National Auto Credit Holding Co, Mercury Finance Co and ACC Consumer Finance Corp with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Started Credit Acceptance Corp as a hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not available.</p>
<p>-- Union Acceptance rose 1/4 to 19, National Auto Credit rose 1/8 to 10-7/8, ACC Consumer rose 1/8 to 9-5/8, Mercury Finance was unchanged at 11-1/2, and Credit Acceptance fell 3/8 to 26-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
